  "details": "Creating unnecessary Ranks with no difference in verification other than one being greater than the other will promote rather elitist behavior. \n\nMake it more personalized instead, Like having it in an order like this: Nuisance -> New user -> Verified User (Those that can upload) -> Friends -> Favorites.\nMake it more centralized on the User instead of some caste system which would only have adverse effects.\n\n Also a little side note is the having to press the okay button on the load screens when it's done loading, It's just unnecessary.",
